cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =(\\operatorname{cos}⁡u)\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x+5).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at $x=2,$ we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(2) & =3\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3\\cdot 2+5) \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{cos}⁡11.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of $y=f(x)$ at $x=2$ is $3\\operatorname{cos}⁡11.$" 13194139533764 true] [17592186249863 1000 #edb/ref 17592186249864 13194139533764 true] [17592186249863 1000 #edb/ref 17592186249865 13194139533764 true] [17592186249863 1000 #edb/ref 17592186249866 13194139533764 true] [17592186249863 1000 #edb/ref 17592186249867 13194139533764 true] [17592186249863 1000 #edb/ref 17592186249868 13194139533764 true] [17592186249863 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533764 true] [17592186249863 1041 "selection" 13194139533764 true] [17592186249863 1104 #edb/ref 17592186249866 13194139533764 true] [17592186249863 1110 #uuid "8fe8829f-3848-511c-aeb8-9a5d23803897" 13194139533764 true] [17592186249864 1034 "-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡11" 13194139533764 true] [17592186249864 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533764 true] [17592186249864 1111 #uuid "76fd204e-60e7-5ff5-9218-21d79e5b7a9e" 13194139533764 true] [17592186249865 1034 "5\\operatorname{cos}⁡11" 13194139533764 true] [17592186249865 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533764 true] [17592186249865 1111 #uuid "3f17b977-aa51-5d8b-aee8-90db30dbda49" 13194139533764 true] [17592186249866 1034 "3\\operatorname{cos}⁡11" 13194139533764 true] [17592186249866 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533764 true] [17592186249866 1111 #uuid "6dc70b98-d298-59c7-938c-cc7c651b0ea8" 13194139533764 true] [17592186249867 1034 "-5\\operatorname{cos}⁡11" 13194139533764 true] [17592186249867 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533764 true] [17592186249867 1111 #uuid "36261555-c139-5597-a434-0b8bd0c91c4e" 13194139533764 true] [17592186249868 1034 "5\\operatorname{cos}⁡2" 13194139533764 true] [17592186249868 1103 #edb/re